{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-422",
  "title": "A different approach",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A different approach"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I'll review the current scene file and then give you practical advice on this situation."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Here's my honest take:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Show him your approach.** Here's why:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Current Framework is Fighting You"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Looking at multicultural-right.ts, you're dealing with a **scene-based declarative config** where:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Components mount/unmount per scene"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "GSAP animations are constrained by the scene lifecycle"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Rich scroll interactions require awkward workarounds"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The `SceneSpec` architecture wasn't designed for continuous scroll choreography"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The client's original stories (invest-york-road.ts etc.) are **perfect for their use case**: discrete content blocks with simple transitions. But you're being asked to add scroll choreography that requires persistent timelines, which fundamentally conflicts with the mount/unmount pattern."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Why Your Instinct is Right"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Architecture mismatch**: You can't retrofit continuous scroll choreography into a scene-based system without it feeling hacky"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Component unmounting kills GSAP**: ScrollTrigger instances need persistent elements, but scenes force remounting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **You're already feeling the pain**: That feeling of \"wishing it was easier\" is your engineering intuition screaming"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "How to Have the Conversation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Don't frame it as \"your framework vs. mine\"**. Frame it as:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> \"I've been exploring how to add the rich scroll interactions you're asking for, and I want to show you two paths:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> **Path A:** Keep extending the current system, but be honest about constraints:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> - Simple scroll effects work great (what you already have)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> - Complex choreography will be limited and harder to maintain"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> - Each new scroll interaction requires creative workarounds"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> **Path B:** I've prototyped an approach optimized for scroll storytelling that:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> - Works seamlessly with GSAP's native patterns"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> - Lets components flow without unmounting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> - Makes complex scroll interactions straightforward"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> - Can recreate your existing stories with the same declarative config style"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> I want to show you the prototype not to throw away your work, but to see if it unlocks the kind of stories you're trying to tell.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Key Point"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Your new approach should *feel* similar to the client**. If they loved the declarative config pattern (which is genuinely elegant), your new architecture should preserve that DX while fixing the scroll animation constraints under the hood."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Looking at your scratch.md, you're already thinking compositionally. Show him working examples of:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-40",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "One of his existing stories rebuilt in 30% less code"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-41",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A scroll interaction that would be painful in the current system but trivial in yours"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What to Avoid"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-44",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Don't say \"your framework is bad\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-45",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Don't make him feel like you're starting over"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-46",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Don't present a solution that looks completely foreign"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-47",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Don't promise to migrate everything—start with one story"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Bottom Line"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You've been hired for your animation expertise. If the framework is blocking you from delivering what he hired you for, **it's your professional responsibility to raise the flag**. Just do it constructively with working alternatives, not just complaints."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Want me to help you build a compelling prototype comparison, or would you rather strategize the specific conversation points?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}